      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "This 7-day itinerary for Rome, Italy, is designed for two adults and two children (ages 8 and 12) from July 15-21, 2024. It balances historical exploration with kid-friendly activities, authentic Italian food, and a moderate pace, allowing for free time.",
